  "data": {
    "id": "lp6557b9a5",
    "name": "THE BLOSSOM KYOTO",
    "hotelDescription": "<p><strong>Luxurious Accommodation in the Heart of Kyoto</strong></p><p><strong>Convenient Location</strong>: Situated in the center of Kyoto, THE BLOSSOM KYOTO offers easy access to popular attractions such as TKP Garden City Kyoto and Gion Shijo Station.</p><p><strong>Modern Amenities</strong>: Enjoy air-conditioned rooms with flat-screen TVs, free WiFi, and a fitness center during your stay. The hotel also provides a 24-hour front desk, luggage storage, and currency exchange for your convenience.</p><p><strong>Dining and Relaxation</strong>: Indulge in delicious meals at the on-site restaurant and unwind with a drink at the bar. Whether you're here for business or leisure, THE BLOSSOM KYOTO offers the perfect blend of comfort and convenience.</p><p>Book your stay at THE BLOSSOM KYOTO now for an unforgettable experience in Kyoto.</p>",
